OL,3,AFrom pit-stops to go-to destinations:
OL,4,AThe transformation of service stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FService stations have been a fixture on
OL,7,Fthe nation's motorway network for more
OL,8,Fthan six decades, but while they may
OL,9,Fonce have been just a place to go when
OL,10,Fneeding a break on a long drive, could
OL,11,Fit be that these roadside retreats have
OL,12,Fnow evolved into destinations in their
OL,13,Fown right?
OL,15,FNext to the motorway near Rotherham,
OL,16,Fwhere traffic seems to be forever
OL,17,Fthundering by, is a covered square,
OL,18,Fsurrounded by what at first appears to
OL,19,Fbe sandy-coloured stone buildings - and
OL,20,Fthere is a general air of calm.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
