OL,3,AFrom pit-stops to go-to destinations:
OL,4,AThe transformation of service stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut this is not one of many pretty
OL,7,Frural villages that dot the Yorkshire
OL,8,Fcountryside - this is actually the
OL,9,Fservice station which was recently
OL,10,Fnamed in survey as the UK's favourite.
OL,12,FWhile it is only mid-morning, the
OL,13,FWelcome Break site's concourse is
OL,14,Falready bustling.
